{"seq":1,"slug":"delta-crdts","title":"Delta CRDT 增量状态型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/practice/delta-crdts","wordCount":1709,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"delta-crdt-增量状态型\">Delta CRDT 增量状态型</h1><p>状态型 CRDT 有一个让它在生产里几乎无法直接使用的硬伤：每次同步都要把整个状态搬过去。一个含百万元素的 OR-Set，哪怕只新增了一个元素，朴素的状态型同步也要把这百万元素重新发一遍。Almeida、Shapiro 等人 2016 年的 δ-CRDT（Delta-state CRDT）给出了优雅的解药——只传刚刚那一点改动产生的「增量」，却仍然完整保留 <a href=\"../state-based/cvrdt-semilattice\">状态 CRDT 与半格</a> 的半格收敛保证。这一篇讲清 δ-mutator、anti-entropy 与因果一致 δ 这三件套，它们是 <a href=\"libraries-systems\">库与系统</a> 里几乎所有现代实现的工程底座。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>δ-mutator</strong>：状态型本地更新原本直接改状态；δ-CRDT 改成一个 mutator <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>δ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它返回一个<strong>与状态同类型</strong>的增量状态 δ（也是半格里的元素），满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>X</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>⊔</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>δ</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X&#x27; = X \\sqcup m^\\delta(X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>增量 δ</strong>：通常极小——向 G-Counter 自增，δ 就只是一个「仅该副本分量有值、其余为底」的向量。δ 可像普通状态一样被传播、被 join。</li>\n<li><strong>anti-entropy（反熵）</strong>：单个 δ 一旦丢失那部分信息可能就缺了，副本需周期性互相比对、按版本补齐缺失的 δ；最朴素的做法是退回发送整个状态。</li>\n<li><strong>δ-interval</strong>：一个 δ 只能被 join 进「已经反映了它的因果前驱」的状态里，把连续 δ 打包成区间整体传播，避免删除 δ 穿越它本该观察到的添加 δ。</li>\n<li><strong>带宽账</strong>：状态型单次同步载荷随规模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，操作型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 但需可靠因果广播，δ-CRDT <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 且可丢可重。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"mutator-把改动装进一个小状态\">δ-mutator：把改动装进一个小状态</h2><p>普通状态型 CRDT 的本地更新直接修改状态；δ-CRDT 的更新则改成一个 <strong>δ-mutator</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>δ</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m^\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它不返回新的完整状态，而是返回一个<strong>与状态同类型</strong>的「增量状态」δ，这个 δ 也是半格里的一个元素，且满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>X</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>⊔</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>δ</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X&#x27; = X \\sqcup m^\\delta(X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即「把增量 join 回原状态」就等于做了一次完整更新。关键在于 δ 通常极小——比如向 G-Counter 自增，δ 就只是一个「仅该副本分量有值、其余为底」的向量。这个 δ 可以像普通状态一样被传播、被 join，因为它本就是半格元素。于是同步消息从「整个状态」缩成「一个 δ」，而合并函数、收敛证明完全沿用状态型那一套，一行不改。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  U[&quot;本地更新&quot;] --&gt; MUT[&quot;δ-mutator 产出增量 δ&lt;br/&gt;与状态同类型的半格元素&quot;]&#10;  MUT --&gt; APPLY[&quot;本地: X ← X ⊔ δ&quot;]&#10;  MUT --&gt; BUF[&quot;δ 加入待发缓冲&quot;]&#10;  BUF --&gt; SEND[&quot;只发送 δ(而非整个 X)&quot;]&#10;  SEND --&gt; REMOTE[&quot;远端: X&#39; ← X&#39; ⊔ δ&quot;]&#10;  REMOTE --&gt; CONV[&quot;同半格 join,收敛不变&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  U[\"本地更新\"] --&gt; MUT[\"δ-mutator 产出增量 δ&lt;br/&gt;与状态同类型的半格元素\"]\n  MUT --&gt; APPLY[\"本地: X ← X ⊔ δ\"]\n  MUT --&gt; BUF[\"δ 加入待发缓冲\"]\n  BUF --&gt; SEND[\"只发送 δ(而非整个 X)\"]\n  SEND --&gt; REMOTE[\"远端: X' ← X' ⊔ δ\"]\n  REMOTE --&gt; CONV[\"同半格 join,收敛不变\"]</pre><h2 id=\"anti-entropy-在坏信道上保证送达\">anti-entropy：在坏信道上保证送达</h2><p>只发 δ 省了带宽，但带来一个新问题：状态型之所以容忍丢包，是因为「整个状态」自带全部信息，丢一次下次补发即可；而单个 δ 一旦丢失，那部分信息可能就缺了。解决靠 <strong>anti-entropy（反熵）算法</strong>——副本周期性地互相比对、补齐缺失的 δ。</p>\n<p>最朴素的反熵是「δ 丢了就退回去发整个状态」，这能保正确但浪费。更聪明的做法是缓存最近发出的若干 δ，副本间用版本信息（类似 <a href=\"../foundations/eventual-consistency\">最终一致性与收敛</a> 里的版本向量）协商「你缺哪几个 δ」，只补那些。这样既省带宽，又不丢收敛性。下表对比三种传播策略的账单：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>单次同步消息大小</th>\n<th>丢包恢复</th>\n<th>因果保证需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素状态型</td>\n<td>整个状态（大）</td>\n<td>下次全量自动覆盖</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>δ-CRDT（无因果）</td>\n<td>单个 δ（小）</td>\n<td>反熵补发，可能退回全量</td>\n<td>无（但合并语义可能偏离操作型）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果一致 δ-CRDT</td>\n<td>δ-interval（小）</td>\n<td>反熵按因果区间补发</td>\n<td>需保证 δ 按因果序合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"因果一致的-别让删除穿越添加\">因果一致的 δ：别让删除穿越添加</h2><p>δ-CRDT 还有一个微妙陷阱。某些 CRDT（如 OR-Set，见 <a href=\"../state-based/sets\">集合</a>）依赖「删除只移除已观察到的添加」这一因果性质。如果 δ 乱序合并——删除的 δ 先于它本该观察到的添加 δ 到达——就可能合并出错误状态。</p>\n<p>2016 年论文为此提出 <strong>δ-interval（δ 区间）反熵</strong>：一个 δ 只能被 join 进「已经反映了它的因果前驱」的状态里。换句话说，反熵补发 δ 时要尊重因果顺序，把连续的 δ 打包成区间整体传播，确保接收方先有前驱再合并后继。这让 δ-CRDT 在保持小消息的同时，恢复了与操作型 <a href=\"../op-based/cmrdt-commutative\">操作 CRDT 与交换性</a> 因果投递相当的正确性，却仍享有状态型「丢了能补、重了无害」的弹性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"带宽账-一次自增的三种成本\">带宽账：一次自增的三种成本</h2><p>把 δ-CRDT 省下的带宽量化。设一个跨 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个副本的 G-Counter，副本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 做一次自增后同步：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传播策略</th>\n<th>单次同步载荷</th>\n<th>随规模增长</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>朴素状态型</td>\n<td>整个长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的向量</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，副本越多越贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作型</td>\n<td>一条「副本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> +1」操作</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，但要可靠因果广播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>δ-CRDT</td>\n<td>一个仅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 分量非底的 δ</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，且可丢可重</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对一个 100 节点的集群，状态型每次心跳搬 100 个分量，δ-CRDT 只搬 1 个——两个数量级的差距。这个例子是计数器，换成百万元素的 OR-Set 差距更悬殊：状态型搬百万元素，δ-CRDT 只搬刚添加的那一个 <code>(元素, 标签)</code> 对。δ-CRDT 拿到操作型级别的带宽，却没付操作型「恰好一次 + 严格因果广播」的运维税——这正是它成为下文事实标准的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么它成了事实标准\">为什么它成了事实标准</h2><p>δ-CRDT 之所以是今天工程落地的主流（见 <a href=\"libraries-systems\">库与系统</a>），因为它精准地占住了状态型与操作型之间的最优位置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>像操作型一样，消息小、增量传播；</li>\n<li>像状态型一样，合并幂等、交换、容忍丢失与重复（配合反熵）；</li>\n<li>不像纯操作型那样强依赖「恰好一次 + 严格因果广播」的可靠消息层，运维门槛低得多。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>它的代价主要是实现复杂度：需要维护待发 δ 缓冲、反熵协议、以及（对因果型 CRDT 而言）δ-interval 的因果记账。此外，δ 缓冲本身会占内存，需要在「确认所有副本已收到」后清理，这又牵出与墓碑回收同源的垃圾回收难题，留给 <a href=\"pitfalls-tradeoffs\">陷阱与权衡</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>δ-CRDT 用 δ-mutator 产出「与状态同类型的小增量 δ」，本地与远端都用同一个半格 join 合并，收敛证明完全沿用状态型。</li>\n<li>它把同步消息从「整个状态」缩成「单个 δ」，兼得操作型的小消息与状态型的弱信道要求。</li>\n<li>单个 δ 易丢，需 anti-entropy 反熵周期性比对补齐；朴素做法退回全量，聪明做法按版本只补缺失 δ。</li>\n<li>依赖因果的 CRDT（如 OR-Set）需用 δ-interval 反熵，保证 δ 按因果序合并，避免删除穿越添加。</li>\n<li>δ-CRDT 是现代库的事实标准，代价是实现复杂与 δ 缓冲的回收；具体实现见 <a href=\"libraries-systems\">库与系统</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Delta CRDT 增量状态型","id":"delta-crdt-增量状态型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"δ-mutator：把改动装进一个小状态","id":"mutator-把改动装进一个小状态"},{"level":2,"text":"anti-entropy：在坏信道上保证送达","id":"anti-entropy-在坏信道上保证送达"},{"level":2,"text":"因果一致的 δ：别让删除穿越添加","id":"因果一致的-别让删除穿越添加"},{"level":2,"text":"带宽账：一次自增的三种成本","id":"带宽账-一次自增的三种成本"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么它成了事实标准","id":"为什么它成了事实标准"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"映射与寄存器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/op-based/maps-registers"},"next":{"title":"库与系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/crdt-conflict-free-types/practice/libraries-systems"}}